    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Step into the enchanting world of Mirror Atelier, where stories and puzzles seamlessly come together. Mirror Atelier invites you into a captivating sliding jigsaw puzzle game that challenges your perception and delights your artistic senses. Each puzzle is a mystery waiting to be unveiled, a fragmented reflection of stylish artwork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe gameplay in Mirror Atelier features familiar classic sliding puzzle mechanics. As you progress, the puzzles increase in complexity, introducing more pieces that will test your spatial reasoning and patience. With each puzzle you solve, fragments of stories unfold to make you feel amused and delighted with your achievement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMirror Atelier offers a tranquil and relaxing environment of artwork and stories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnter Mirror Atelier today and slide into a world of artistic discovery and narrative charm!",
    "about_the_game": "Step into the enchanting world of Mirror Atelier, where stories and puzzles seamlessly come together. Mirror Atelier invites you into a captivating sliding jigsaw puzzle game that challenges your perception and delights your artistic senses. Each puzzle is a mystery waiting to be unveiled, a fragmented reflection of stylish artwork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe gameplay in Mirror Atelier features familiar classic sliding puzzle mechanics. As you progress, the puzzles increase in complexity, introducing more pieces that will test your spatial reasoning and patience. With each puzzle you solve, fragments of stories unfold to make you feel amused and delighted with your achievement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMirror Atelier offers a tranquil and relaxing environment of artwork and stories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnter Mirror Atelier today and slide into a world of artistic discovery and narrative charm!",
    "short_description": "Mirror Atelier is an story-rich, relaxing, sliding puzzle game where artwork and stories come together. Solve fragmented artworks, piece by piece, to unlock delightful narrative snippets. Challenge your perception and immerse yourself in this tranquil adventure.",
